{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“剩余域”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"剩余域"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"局部环","text":"局部环"}},{"Plain":"的剩余域是它唯一的极大理想的商.</p>\n<p>设 $(K,\\|{-}\\|)$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"非Archimedes赋值域","text":"非 Archimedes 赋值域"}},{"Plain":", $\\mathcal O_K=\\{x\\in K\\mid \\|x\\|\\leq 1\\}$ 为其"},{"Local":{"url":"赋值环","text":"赋值环"}},{"Plain":", 其唯一的极大理想为 $\\mathfrak m=\\{x\\in K\\mid\\|x\\|&lt;1\\}$. 此时称 $\\mathcal O_K/\\mathfrak m$ 为 $K$ 的剩余域.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"整概形","text":"整概形"}},{"Plain":" $X$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"一般点","text":"一般点"}},{"Plain":" $\\eta$ 处的剩余域同构于茎 $\\mathcal O_{X,\\eta}$ 的分式域.</p>\n"}]}}